      "description": "用于试听、沿用文案和记录展开等辅助操作。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-quiet\" type=\"button\">沿用文案新建</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-quiet{font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;min-height:44px;padding:11px 18px;display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:9px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s ease-out,color .18s ease-out;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#20362f);border-color:var(--line,#d9dfd4)}.ds-button-quiet:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--soft,#e6eee4)}.ds-button-quiet:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-button-quiet:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--green,#245e47);outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){button{transition:none!important}}"
