      "description": "当前任务用纸白色面和边框标记，时间和状态保持紧凑。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-history\" aria-label=\"制作记录\"><button class=\"ds-history-item\" type=\"button\" aria-current=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-history-title\">已保存的视频文案</span><span class=\"ds-history-meta\"><span>09/22 16:46</span><span class=\"ds-history-done\">已完成</span></span></button><button class=\"ds-history-item\" type=\"button\" aria-current=\"false\"><span class=\"ds-history-title\">下一支视频文案</span><span class=\"ds-history-meta\"><span>09/22 16:42</span><span>正在制作</span></span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-history{max-width:240px;background:var(--side,#eceee5);padding:12px}.ds-history-item{font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",system-ui,sans-serif;display:block;width:100%;padding:13px 11px;margin:0 0 5px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;text-align:left;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#20362f);cursor:pointer}.ds-history-item:hover{background:#e4e9de}.ds-history-item[aria-current=true]{background:var(--paper,#fffefa);border-color:var(--line,#d9dfd4)}.ds-history-title{display:block;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;font-size:13px;font-weight:500}.ds-history-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;color:var(--muted,#536359);font-size:11px;margin-top:8px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-history-done{color:var(--green,#245e47)}.ds-history-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--green,#245e47);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "任务状态标签",
