      "refersTo": "state-tag",
      "description": "用文字配合功能色表达普通、异常和待核对状态。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-state-examples\"><span class=\"ds-state\" role=\"status\">已完成</span><span class=\"ds-state\" data-state=\"interrupted\" role=\"status\">制作中断</span><span class=\"ds-state\" data-state=\"uncertain\" role=\"status\">等待核对</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-state-examples{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}.ds-state{font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:var(--green,#245e47);background:var(--soft,#e6eee4);border-radius:5px;padding:5px 8px}.ds-state[data-state=interrupted]{color:var(--red,#a33224);background:#f6e5dd}.ds-state[data-state=uncertain]{color:var(--amber,#835811);background:#f4ebd7}"
    },
